{"actor":"Erik Frèrejean","comment":null,"created_at":"2026-03-03T10:47:45Z","event_type":"closed","id":139,"issue_id":"weg-rv4.1","new_value":"{\"status\":\"closed\"}","old_value":"{\"id\":\"weg-rv4.1\",\"title\":\"Define reorder executor and validator contracts\",\"description\":\"Define interfaces for the reorder executor (responsible for persisting sort-order changes to the database) and the reorder validator (responsible for checking whether a proposed move is valid). Separating execution from validation allows the reorder executor to be swapped without affecting validation logic.\",\"acceptance_criteria\":\"Executor interface defines a method to persist a sort-order change\\nValidator interface defines a method to check move validity\\nInterfaces are injectable via DI container\\nExecutor can be swapped without affecting validation logic\",\"status\":\"open\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"owner\":\"erik@wedevelop.nl\",\"created_at\":\"2026-02-16T14:24:47Z\",\"created_by\":\"Erik Frèrejean\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-16T16:09:32Z\",\"work_type\":\"mutex\"}"}
{"actor":"Erik Frèrejean","comment":null,"created_at":"2026-03-03T10:47:45Z","event_type":"closed","id":140,"issue_id":"weg-rv4.2","new_value":"{\"status\":\"closed\"}","old_value":"{\"id\":\"weg-rv4.2\",\"title\":\"Implement element reorder service\",\"description\":\"Create the orchestrating service for element reordering. It coordinates the validator (to check hierarchy rules and circular references), the executor (to persist sort changes), and handles cross-area parent updates (when an element moves between containers).\",\"acceptance_criteria\":\"Service rejects moves that violate hierarchy rules\\nService rejects moves that would create circular references\\nCross-area moves update the element parent area\\nService returns structured results (success or specific failure reason)\",\"status\":\"open\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"owner\":\"erik@wedevelop.nl\",\"created_at\":\"2026-02-16T14:24:57Z\",\"created_by\":\"Erik Frèrejean\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-16T16:09:32Z\",\"work_type\":\"mutex\"}"}
{"actor":"Erik Frèrejean","comment":null,"created_at":"2026-03-03T10:47:46Z","event_type":"closed","id":141,"issue_id":"weg-rv4.3","new_value":"{\"status\":\"closed\"}","old_value":"{\"id\":\"weg-rv4.3\",\"title\":\"Implement reorder executor with correct sort positioning\",\"description\":\"Implement the reorder executor that persists sort-order changes to the database. The executor must calculate correct sort positions for all move directions: forward moves, backward moves, and cross-area moves. If the upstream SilverStripe Elemental framework has a reorder off-by-one bug, this executor provides the corrected calculation.\",\"acceptance_criteria\":\"Forward move (position 1 to position 3) places element correctly after position 3\\nBackward move (position 3 to position 1) places element correctly at position 1\\nCross-area move places element at the correct position in the target container\\nSort positions of surrounding elements are recalculated correctly\",\"status\":\"open\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"owner\":\"erik@wedevelop.nl\",\"created_at\":\"2026-02-16T14:25:06Z\",\"created_by\":\"Erik Frèrejean\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-16T16:09:32Z\",\"work_type\":\"mutex\"}"}
{"actor":"Erik Frèrejean","comment":null,"created_at":"2026-03-03T10:47:47Z","event_type":"closed","id":142,"issue_id":"weg-rv4.4","new_value":"{\"status\":\"closed\"}","old_value":"{\"id\":\"weg-rv4.4\",\"title\":\"Expose reorder AJAX endpoint\",\"description\":\"Create an AJAX endpoint for element reordering that the frontend calls during drag-and-drop operations. The endpoint accepts source element ID, target area ID, and target position. It validates the CSRF token, checks canEdit() permission on both source and target areas.\",\"acceptance_criteria\":\"Endpoint accepts source element, target area, and position parameters\\nRequests without valid CSRF token are rejected\\nPermission is checked on both source and target areas\\nResponse follows the standard success/error envelope format\",\"status\":\"open\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"owner\":\"erik@wedevelop.nl\",\"created_at\":\"2026-02-16T14:25:18Z\",\"created_by\":\"Erik Frèrejean\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-16T16:09:32Z\",\"work_type\":\"mutex\"}"}
