{"actor":"Erik Frèrejean","comment":null,"created_at":"2026-03-03T10:49:41Z","event_type":"status_changed","id":144,"issue_id":"weg-ib7","new_value":"{\"status\":\"in_progress\"}","old_value":"{\"id\":\"weg-ib7\",\"title\":\"Use proper HTTP methods for ElementalGridController routes\",\"description\":\"All mutation endpoints use POST regardless of semantics. Update to: PATCH for publish/unpublish/reorder (state changes), DELETE for delete (removal). POST stays for create/duplicate (resource creation). Requires updating backend url_handlers, frontend API client (add apiPatch/apiDelete), endpoints, exports, and all related tests.\",\"status\":\"open\",\"priority\":2,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"owner\":\"erik@wedevelop.nl\",\"created_at\":\"2026-03-03T09:49:38Z\",\"created_by\":\"Erik Frèrejean\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-03T09:49:38Z\"}"}
